  "origin": {
    "kind": "new",
    "note": "Written for live-mix on cpp/kit. Modal synthesis in the tradition of Adrien's Modalys and the MI Elements/Rings resonators in outline only: each mode is a rotating complex one-pole. Mode ratios are textbook and measured values (Rossing, The Science of Percussion Instruments; Fletcher and Rossing; Inacio, Henrique and Antunes on Tibetan bowls), rounded. Not a model of a particular instrument."
